  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "签约冻结与危机公关  (Frozen Contract and Crisis PR)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When word arrives that the rival agency has frozen Xin Huimei's contract amid the tabloid storm, Chun Yuqiao immediately spots a bigger move than routine paperwork. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，这几个文件急着要签字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那边经纪公司有回复了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "正要跟你说这事呢，之前不给，现在他们又给了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们跟辛惠美的签约已经冻结了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在全力进入全明星计划，约你开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么全明星计划？我们这儿做危机公关呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "公关什么？什么比合同还重要？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛小姐，我想再见个面，方便吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好，老地方见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "私人约会？老大？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大露出了复仇之笑！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，这几个文件急着要签字。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, these documents urgently need your signature.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那边经纪公司有回复了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has there been a reply from the talent agency yet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "正要跟你说这事呢，之前不给，现在他们又给了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was just about to tell you—earlier they held back, and now they suddenly said yes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他们跟辛惠美的签约已经冻结了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Their contract signing with Xin Huimei has already been frozen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在全力进入全明星计划，约你开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now they are throwing everything into the All-Star project and want a meeting with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "什么全明星计划？我们这儿做危机公关呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Forget the All-Star project—we are handling crisis public relations right here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "公关什么？什么比合同还重要？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Crisis PR for what? What could be more important than the contract?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛小姐，我想再见个面，方便吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Miss Xin, I would like to meet again—is it convenient for you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好，老地方见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, see you at the usual place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "私人约会？老大？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A private meeting? Boss?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大露出了复仇之笑！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss just flashed a smile of revenge!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，这几个文件急着要签字。",
      "gap": 0.5
